<MainLayout title="About NeoMBSE" description="Why NeoMBSE is building an independent, evidence-led UML and SysML tools directory.">
  <article class="section container narrow prose">
    <p class="eyebrow">About the project</p>
    <h1>A clearer map of modeling tools.</h1>
    <p class="lead">NeoMBSE is an independent directory for people choosing UML and SysML tools for software architecture, systems engineering, and model-based engineering.</p>
    <h2>Why this directory exists</h2>
    <p>Tool lists often mix semantic model editors with drawing applications, platform support with browser access, and open-source software with paid hosted services. Those distinctions matter when a team makes a technical choice.</p>
    <p>NeoMBSE makes those distinctions explicit. Each record separates platform, access method, runtime, supported standards, modeling interface, license, and evidence-backed capabilities.</p>
    <h2>Editorial independence</h2>
    <p>Vendors may submit corrections and updates, but submissions are reviewed before publication. Any future paid placement will be labeled as sponsored and will not change capability findings or editorial rankings.</p>
  </article>
</MainLayout>
